# The Lab bundle's sqlite3 (EPOCH-439): the CLI the processor's repair pass runs.
# sqlite.org publishes SHA3-256, not SHA-256, for its downloads; the tarball is
# refused unless its SHA3-256 is this one. The iPhone libraries' pins are the
# app's own (apps/epoch/src/main/tools/device-backup/ios/toolchain/pins.ts).
SQLITE_VERSION=3.54.1
SQLITE_URL=https://www.sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-autoconf-3540100.tar.gz
SQLITE_SHA3_256=b6ced585c750916b1052667239a12c25a7ff34e7f06e1e6e01ecb0427657d9c4
